{
	"_readme": [
		"Owner rulings on the 85 spells whose damage the backfill could not read (M19).",
		"The rule: a spell fills its damage fields only when IT deals the damage, as part",
		"of casting or as a lingering effect it maintains. A spell that raises someone",
		"else's damage fills nothing. Where a spell deals damage in several instances,",
		"the primary instance is the one recorded.",
		"",
		"Attribute: the corpus writes `+N damage` when the caster's magic attribute adds",
		"on top, and a bare `N damage` when the number is the whole of it — the same",
		"reading docs/05-combat/02-attacking.md § Damage gives. That is the signal",
		"these rulings follow (owner-confirmed).",
		"",
		"`null` means no block: the spell deals no damage of its own.",
		"Applied by `bun run spells:damage-rulings`. The content:gen damage gate then",
		"checks every number against its effect text."
	],

